# CODEOWNERS — https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners
#
# Review routing for pull requests; the branch ruleset (.github/rulesets/main.json)
# gates merge on the CI workflow's all_green check and on an extra approval for
# changes not attributed to the PR author. Owners are teams, not people, so
# membership changes never touch this file. Later lines win.
# Default owner for everything.
*                               @get-sybers/maintainers
# CI/CD and repository policy need the owners' sign-off.
/.github/                       @get-sybers/owners
/.pre-commit-config.yaml        @get-sybers/owners
/.pinact.yaml                   @get-sybers/owners
/Makefile                       @get-sybers/owners
/scripts/                       @get-sybers/owners
# Version pins and the source manifest are a reviewed change.
/requirements.yml               @get-sybers/owners
/test-requirements.txt          @get-sybers/owners
/source.yml                     @get-sybers/owners
/blueprints/FGNW/requirements.yml @get-sybers/owners
/blueprints/FGNW/blueprint.yml  @get-sybers/owners
/CONTRIBUTING.md                @get-sybers/owners
/MAINTAINERS                    @get-sybers/owners
